Cell["\<\
Forms each broadening as I (sigma - ConjugateTranspose[sigma]).\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1577814603,ExpressionUUID->"8a3d1381-6bb2-7e48-884e-0f41872cdc10"],

Cell["\<\
Returns Tr[gammaP . g . gammaQ . ConjugateTranspose[g]]. Both self-energies \
and g must use the same basis.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1179441311,ExpressionUUID->"473551ee-2719-9b49-a109-121cc70430d2"],

Cell["\<\
The routine performs no real-part extraction or clipping; negligible \
numerical imaginary residues may remain.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->1661417413,ExpressionUUID->"36707e56-8c68-fc43-a9a0-4b56497be3e2"]
}, Closed]],

